   <name>Tornado Watch issued October 10 at 2:04PM EDT until October 10 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Columbia SC</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_extreme</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>THE NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE HAS ISSUED TORNADO WATCH 679 IN
EFFECT UNTIL 8 PM EDT THIS EVENING FOR THE FOLLOWING AREAS

IN GEORGIA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 1 COUNTY

IN EAST CENTRAL GEORGIA

BURKE

IN SOUTH CAROLINA THIS WATCH INCLUDES 3 COUNTIES

IN CENTRAL SOUTH CAROLINA

BAMBERG               BARNWELL              ORANGEBURG

THIS INCLUDES THE CITIES OF BAMBERG, BARNWELL, BLACKVILLE,
BROOKDALE, DENMARK, ORANGEBURG, WAYNESBORO, AND WILLISTON.</Snippet>
