   <name>Marine Weather Statement issued October 10 at 2:01PM EDT by NWS Tampa Bay Ruskin FL</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>The areas affected include...
Coastal waters from Tarpon Springs to Suwannee River FL out 20
NM...

At 201 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated strong thunderstorms, capable
of producing winds to around 30 knots. These thunderstorms were
located along a line extending from near Suwannee River to 18 nm west
of Ozello, moving northeast at 25 knots.</Snippet>
