   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued October 10 at 1:52PM EDT until October 11 at 11:00PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...East winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt expected.

* WHERE...Tidal Potomac River from Key Bridge to Cobb Island MD,
Chesapeake Bay north of Pooles Island MD, Patapsco River
including Baltimore Harbor, Chester River to Queenstown MD,
Eastern Bay, Choptank River to Cambridge MD and the Little
Choptank River, and Patuxent River to Broomes Island MD.

* WHEN...From 1 AM to 11 PM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
